---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import HeroDecor from '../components/HeroDecor.astro';
import ImagePlaceholder from '../components/ImagePlaceholder.astro';
import TestimonialGallery from '../components/TestimonialGallery.astro';
import '../styles/home.css';

const heroWords = ['Reading', 'and', 'Spelling', 'Intervention'];
---

<BaseLayout mainClass="home-main">
	<section class="home-hero">
		<HeroDecor />
		<div class="home-hero-copy">
			<h1 class="home-hero-title">
				{
					heroWords.map((word, index) => (
						<span class="home-hero-word" style={`--word-i: ${index}`}>{word}</span>
					))
				}
			</h1>
			<p class="home-hero-tagline">Effective · Interactive · Research-based</p>
			<a class="meeting-nav home-hero-meet" href="#meeting">Set up a meeting</a>
		</div>
		<div class="home-hero-art">
			<ImagePlaceholder shot="hero" />
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="home-intro" aria-labelledby="home-intro-heading">
		<h2 id="home-intro-heading">Hello! I am Erin Trapp, your literacy and Dyslexia specialist.</h2>
		<p>
			I use the <a href="https://bartonreading.com/">Barton Reading &amp; Spelling System</a> to
			help students who struggle with reading due to Dyslexia or other learning
			challenges. I meet with students online, providing an interactive, safe, and
			positive learning environment.
		</p>

		<div class="home-about-row">
			<ImagePlaceholder shot="about" />
			<details class="home-about">
				<summary>
					<span class="home-about-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
					<span class="home-about-label">
						<span class="home-about-title">More about Erin</span>
						<span class="home-about-cue">Open to read Erin’s story</span>
					</span>
				</summary>
				<div class="home-about-body">
					<p>
						Hi, I'm Erin Trapp! I am a K-12 teacher, and I completed my BA in Teaching
						English as a Second Language at Winona State University. My specialties are
						Dyslexia, Literacy, ESL, Spanish, and Early Childhood Development. I have a
						wide range of teaching experiences, including 1st grade, 7th grade literacy,
						high school Spanish and ESL, Pre-K, as well as six years of one-on-one
						virtual tutoring.
					</p>
					<p>
						During the beginning years of my teaching career, I observed students at
						various levels struggle with literacy. I was struck by the lack of adequate
						support for students with Dyslexia in the traditional educational system, and
						I wanted to become a part of the solution. I dove into studying the
						challenges that students with Dyslexia face and discovered the importance of
						learning an Orton-Gillingham based approach. In speaking with a Barton tutor
						with 15+ years of experience, who later became my mentor, I was inspired by
						the structure and proven effectiveness of the Barton Reading &amp; Spelling
						System. Combining my years of experience in one-on-one tutoring and my
						passion for literacy, I became a Barton-trained, full-time tutor. The ability
						to read opens up a world of opportunities, and it is such rewarding work to
						empower students with this skill.
					</p>
					<p>
						Many students who struggle with reading have had very difficult,
						humiliating, and demoralizing experiences in traditional educational
						settings. It is no surprise that they would have some hesitation about
						starting tutoring for reading and spelling! During my online sessions, I
						strive to make the student feel safe, comfortable, encouraged, and
						challenged. My passion is empowering students to master skills that they
						thought were inaccessible to them and have fun while doing it!
					</p>
				</div>
			</details>
		</div>
	</section>

	<TestimonialGallery />
</BaseLayout>
